            "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:41:09.704078+00:00",
            "notes": "I consider [Royal Bullets](item_3dee6c30-86d8-4d60-b877-4d78b6a6da7c) the best power in Stadium. It wounds enemies you critical hit with your Scattergun, giving you good self sustain even early on. Positioning is important, play around cover and corners and go for headshots, dont just tunnelvision on shooting the enemy tank. \n\nYou will be fragile early, so play accordingly. Play safe but poke aggressively, use cover and mid-range to your advantage and avoid head-on fights with the enemy tank unless they push too far, which is when you can punish them. Save your [Commanding Shout](ability_dfbb8e50-5815-42c8-8a6e-9bb20bf6cc59) for either disengaging when you're at a disadvantage or engaging when you have an advantage.",
