            "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:41:09.704078+00:00",
            "notes": "Due to [Reckoner's Roar](item_efe615c6-8b32-4847-9d8f-4f55adaeba52), our [Commanding Shout](ability_dfbb8e50-5815-42c8-8a6e-9bb20bf6cc59) now wounds enemies around us, adding damage and self-healing, giving us more survivability and making our engaging deadlier. [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) gives us a nice boost in [Ability Power](stat_ability_power). In fact, just one headshot with Scattergun will give us all 5 stacks of the 5% [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) boost.\n\nKeep your [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) active at all times to maximize our [Commanding Shout](ability_dfbb8e50-5815-42c8-8a6e-9bb20bf6cc59)'s damage and healing.",
